[font_size=32]The Team[/font_size]
[url=https://aaronmccabe.itch.io/]Aaron McCabe[/url] - 3D/Environment Artist 
[url=https://decooced.itch.io/]Declan Phillips[/url] - Programmer, Game Designer
[url=https://sites.google.com/view/finnarchergamedesignportfolio]Finn Archer[/url] - Game Designer, Level Designer
[url=https://ma123.itch.io/]Minh Anh Pham[/url] - 2D/3D Artist, Musician 
[url=https://sites.google.com/view/mikhail-fisenko-gamedesign]Mikhail Fisenko[/url] - Project Lead, Programmer, Audio Engineer 

[font_size=32]Special Thanks To:[/font_size]
Peter Lynch - Project Supervisor
Alex Cahill - Project Supervisor
John Healy - Lecturer

Ivan Saraev - German Translation 
Jake Duffy - Irish Translation
Evgenia Malliou - Greek Translation
Dilara Özileri - Turkish, French Translation
Oleksandr Romash - Ukrainian Translation
Goosebatss - Spanish Translation
Koko - Japanese Translation

Without your help and guidance this game would not have been possible.




